  (text "J1 is a 2x5 IDC: pin n = DE-9 pin n for 1..9; pin 10 is spare." (at 30 541 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "961c46d3-6f78-482c-b391-63f014160dcd"))
  (text "Pin 7 is +12.6 V DC direct from the machine (2.02 A rail), NOT via R21." (at 30 547 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "2746749a-4aca-4a9d-ba15-bb1d276b9a02"))
  (text "U1/U2 translate the 5 V TTL side; U3 is the open-drain MSB sink." (at 30 553 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "76c456a8-8951-41a4-a23f-84410516b09f"))
  (text "U4 MAX3232 runs on 3V3 so its drivers swing +/-5.5 V into the bipolar RXD." (at 30 559 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a5018cf4-a404-409f-9c56-5c453642a178"))
  (text "U6 = panel expander 0x58 (P0 push-pull CC, P1 open-drain). U7 = handshake 0x59." (at 30 565 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "79334eeb-511a-47df-8a42-65855ee50c26"))
  (text "Both expanders are fitted: neither is full, so the pin budget is closed." (at 30 571 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "2e766581-629c-4db9-baf8-a4e563d75ae8"))
